{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humble black pawn decided to challenge the first rule of chess. The white pieces were not happy about this at all. The result? War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/b09760373479ad37c4b54f2a801ac4c5.poster.avif?t=1758713082\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/b09760373479ad37c4b54f2a801ac4c5.webm?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/b09760373479ad37c4b54f2a801ac4c5.mp4?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PAWN WITH A GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the black pawn across various chessboards, following the rules of movement, defense, and attack from classical chess but with a twist: the black pawn has the movement capabilities of a king and can push black pieces, commanding them to attack on your orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/353d38eaf608651028c09e6d6d2a76f7.poster.avif?t=1758713082\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/353d38eaf608651028c09e6d6d2a76f7.webm?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/353d38eaf608651028c09e6d6d2a76f7.mp4?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SHOP TO GEAR UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pawn is not alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/72667107d757db0edb61e5b9abca8e2b.poster.avif?t=1758713082\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/72667107d757db0edb61e5b9abca8e2b.webm?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/72667107d757db0edb61e5b9abca8e2b.mp4?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BRAIN WILL MELT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles will require logical thinking, agility, and creativity to find solutions and achieve the objective of each level (there are 60 levels with progressively increasing difficulty).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/da01050fa0ffb6cc0e02ed9c26e392e4.poster.avif?t=1758713082\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/da01050fa0ffb6cc0e02ed9c26e392e4.webm?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/da01050fa0ffb6cc0e02ed9c26e392e4.mp4?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a story mode with a world map, collectibles, and an item shop, where you can gather money to purchase upgrades as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative chess-based game with a captivating story of rebellion.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434710/d628e134c2057fb11b