713082","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3504090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humble black pawn decided to challenge the first rule of chess. The white pieces were not happy about this at all. The result? War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/b09760373479ad37c4b54f2a801ac4c5.poster.avif?t=1758713082\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/b09760373479ad37c4b54f2a801ac4c5.webm?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/b09760373479ad37c4b54f2a801ac4c5.mp4?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PAWN WITH A GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the black pawn across various chessboards, following the rules of movement, defense, and attack from classical chess but with a twist: the black pawn has the movement capabilities of a king and can push black pieces, commanding them to attack on your orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/353d38eaf608651028c09e6d6d2a76f7.poster.avif?t=1758713082\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/353d38eaf608651028c09e6d6d2a76f7.webm?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/353d38eaf608651028c09e6d6d2a76f7.mp4?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SHOP TO GEAR UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pawn is not alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/72667107d757db0edb61e5b9abca8e2b.poster.avif?t=1758713082\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/72667107d757db0edb61e5b9abca8e2b.webm?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/72667107d757db0edb61e5b9abca8e2b.mp4?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BRAIN WILL MELT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles will require logical thinking, agility, and creativity to find solutions and achieve the objective of each level (there are 60 levels with progressively increasing difficulty).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/da01050fa0ffb6cc0e02ed9c26e392e4.poster.avif?t=1758713082\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/da01050fa0ffb6cc0e02ed9c26e392e4.webm?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/extras/da01050fa0ffb6cc0e02ed9c26e392e4.mp4?t=1758713082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a story mode with a world map, collectibles, and an item shop, where you can gather money to purchase upgrades as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative chess-based game with a captivating story of rebellion.</strong></p>","developers":["Enchant Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434710/header.jpg?t=1758713082","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved to Enchant Games.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3434710/809682/ad50dbea530c3c2485302fa879600e84f706bd4d/1750850686/dash_av1.mpd?t=1737294216","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3434710/809682/ad50dbea530c3c2485302fa879600e84f706bd4d/1750850686/dash_h264.mpd?t=1737294216","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3434710/809682/ad50dbea530c3c2485302fa879600e84f706bd4d/1750850686/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1737294216","id":257087378,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087378/movie480.mp4?t=1737294216","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087378/movie_max.mp4?t=1737294216"},"name":"trailer01","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257087378/036857f1e36f55e1480870cab25f2be31e447867/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737294216","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087378/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737294216","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087378/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1737294216"}}],"name":"Black Pieces Move First","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","se